# Killer's Mask (3): its enters trigger manifests dread (CR 701.62a) - of Guerrilla Gorilla and Lightning Bolt the Gorilla goes face
# down as a 2/2 and the Bolt to the graveyard - then attaches the Equipment to that creature (CR 701.3a), so the face-down
# permanent has menace (CR 702.111). Equip {2} (CR 702.6) at sorcery speed moves it to the Ornithopter (flying and menace); the
# pool is empty after paying exactly {2}, and with the Mask gone the face-down 2/2 has no keywords again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Killer's Mask
Ornithopter
Swamp x2
Guerrilla Gorilla
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Killer's Mask.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Guerrilla Gorilla | Lightning Bolt)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
? Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDown = true
? Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDownName = Guerrilla Gorilla
? Bot1.Battlefield..Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield..Keywords = Menace
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Killer's Mask.Activate(Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Killer's Mask.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying; Menace
? Bot1.Battlefield..Keywords = (absent)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Killer's Mask.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying; Menace
Bot1.Battlefield..Power = 2
